      "doi": "Nat Commun. 17, 2026. DOI: 10.1038/s41467-026-76988-1",
      "identifier": "2532",
      "name": "Differential lipid selectivity of StARD phospholipid transporters revealed by native MS"
    }
  ],
  "conditionsOfAccess": "Open",
  "date": "2026-07-23",
  "dateCreated": "2026-07-23",
  "description": "This dataset contains LC-MS/MS, native MS2, and direct infusion mass spectrometry raw files of lipid extracts and purified proteins (STARD2, STARD7 and STARD10) obtained from E. coli cells, HEK293S cells, and HepG2 cells cultured under different conditions. Those include overexpression or siRNA-mediated knockdown of the lipid transfer proteins STARD2, STARD7, or STARD10. MS2 spectra show copurified lipids released from purified proteins by HCD; MS1 spectra were recorded by direct infusion of whole-cell lipid extracts; LC-MS/MS data were recorded of lipids extracted from purified proteins expressed in E. coli. This dataset supports the publication \"Differential lipid selectivity of StARD phospholipid transporters revealed by native MS\". Experimental details are described in the corresponding publication",
